      "bytes": 117887,
      "pages": 1,
      "title_tex": "Incomplete configuration permits both achiral and chiral completions.",
      "legend_tex": "(A) A partially configured 2,3-dichlorobutane fixes the upper center and leaves the lower required center unresolved. (B,C) Completing the lower center yields a meso configuration or a chiral configuration. The drawings use Fischer projections: horizontal bonds point towards the viewer and vertical bonds away; dashed lower arms in (A) indicate missing configuration, not a geometric assignment. The strict input therefore returns incomplete. A source-declared assessment concerns only its represented registry; a completion-population assessment quantifies over the admitted completions. These are different questions under the same declared identity profile.",
