      "pages": 1,
      "title_tex": "The two-stage quotient used in theory and validation.",
      "legend_tex": "Budgets A and B exhaust the displayed raw products. Formal C exhausts all nine C cases; the raw C result is deliberately labelled as the complete VS146 slice rather than as the infeasible full C product. Every reported raw encoding maps to its formal tuple and then to the same exact global class.",
