      "bytes": 62797,
      "pages": 1,
      "title_tex": "Task-separated overview of the frozen benchmark evidence.",
      "legend_tex": "Each tile carries one hero ratio, its own denominator, and its own truth contract: exact identity and relation laws (A), carrier perception (B), downstream CIP naming (C), and ACS whole-molecule chirality (D). Every meter is printed with its numeric rate, and each is read against its own tile only. Panel C reports \\(\\CipCoordinatesExactRecords/\\CipCoordinatesRecords\\) as exact-record accuracy, alongside label recall and precision. All 300 inputs have pinned coordinates; 187 is the number with an exactly correct predicted label set. The four tiles are reported side by side but are never pooled into one accuracy statistic.",
